# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF on checkout while Prettier defaults to
# endOfLine "lf" — so a fresh clone on Windows fails `npm run format:check`, and therefore
# `npm run verify`, before a single line of code is touched. The documented acceptance test would
# fail for reasons that have nothing to do with the harness.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
